#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Cacti records this outcome before verifying account enabled, realm authorization, or 2FA completion; a session may not have been established."
msgstr "Cacti teken hierdie uitkoms aan voordat rekeningaktivering, gebiedsmagtiging of 2FA-voltooiing geverifieer word; 'n sessie is moontlik nie gevestig nie."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "No current Cacti path writes this signature; recorded defensively as a possible password change with an unconfirmed outcome."
msgstr "Geen huidige Cacti-pad skryf hierdie handtekening nie; defensief aangeteken as 'n moontlike wagwoordverandering met 'n onbevestigde uitkoms."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Cacti user_log result=3 with user_id=0 may be a password change or a failed 2FA challenge; the table cannot disambiguate."
msgstr "Cacti user_log result=3 met user_id=0 kan 'n wagwoordverandering of 'n mislukte 2FA-uitdaging wees; die tabel kan nie tussen die twee onderskei nie."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Audit administration permission is required to save these settings."
msgstr "Oudit-administrasietoestemming word vereis om hierdie instellings te stoor."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Authentication auditing was not enabled. Run the audit_auth_indexes.php CLI maintenance command first."
msgstr "Stawingsouditering was nie geaktiveer nie. Voer eers die audit_auth_indexes.php CLI-instandhoudingsopdrag uit."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
